WEBVTT

00:04:28.121 --> 00:04:30.538
HouseTrip versus Airbnb.

00:04:30.913 --> 00:04:34.204
I bet you haven't booked your last
vacation on HouseTrip, have you?

00:04:34.204 --> 00:04:35.704
You get the idea.

00:04:37.038 --> 00:04:41.829
What we found is that trust
does play a meaningful role

00:04:41.871 --> 00:04:45.329
between success and failure
of business ecosystems.

00:04:46.121 --> 00:04:48.871
It wasn't always
the final nail in the coffin,

00:04:48.913 --> 00:04:52.454
but it was relevant [enough]
to send more than half to the graveyard.

00:04:52.829 --> 00:04:53.954
Why was that?

00:04:54.788 --> 00:04:57.204
Many of the failed ecosystems
made the mistake

00:04:57.204 --> 00:05:01.454
of naively assuming that cooperation
anchored on trust